The files in this directory (data/) form the incident dataset released with
the paper "Provenance-Checked Tool Calls: A Model-Free Reference Monitor
for LLM Agents" (M. B. Ali, N. Ali, M. A. Iqbal and M. S. Saleem; ARCAI 2026):

* incidents.csv                    the 80 coded events (author's coding)
* incidents_coder2.csv             blind second coding of lens and vector
* incidents_coder3.csv             blind third coding of type, lens and vector
* incidents_coder3_agreement.json  agreement statistics between codings
* tool_signatures.json             tool signatures used by the policy tables
* human_coding/                    blind 20-event sheet and scoring script

They are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
licence. In short, you are free to:

